{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He seems like he's in kind of a daze.\n\"What do we... what do we talk about?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:14:14.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738217864103985193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"“Anything you want... actually, I do have a request for conversation, if you don’t mind.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:15:23.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738218156341854278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Anything you want!,\" he announces a little louder than he intends.\n\"...anything,\" he sheepishly corrects more quietly, a moment later.","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:17:21.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738218651131445290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"“I want to hear about you, ♪.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:17:42.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738218737139974255","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"He gets a little shy, looking happily up at them through this hug he refuses to end.\n\"I never imagined... where do I start?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:22:06.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738219844683563048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"“Start from when you were a kid. I want to hear your whole story, from you.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:24:07.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738220353448575007","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Well - I was a kid, just... out there. In the forests, and the trees.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:34:45.324000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738223027699056760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"There was always rumors out there about magic, and fairies, and - that's what I became a part of.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:36:59.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738223590406619236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I spent a lot of my time in the Feywild. I stumbled through the crossing on accident the first time, but Surya found me. She said she saw something, but never what.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:38:45.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738224035590307944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"They listen, smiling softly.","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:40:09.222000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738224386225602631","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"She's the one who taught me about the stars. Said she always imagined I'd be able to see all my friends, even when I was on the Material, through them.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:40:46.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738224542438391868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I could never really _stay_ there though. I wasn't a fey, and I couldn't pretend to be one. So instead, Surya had me protect the crossing I found. Sometimes adventurers would follow rumors, and stir up trouble in that neck of the woods. I scared them off for a while.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:42:08.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738224887717691514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"There were lots of tribal people around there. Goblins and kobolds mostly. \nSome of my best friends. I protected them too, after a while.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:42:46.964000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225047843635330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Eventually, though, instead of coming to see the Feywild, we realized they were coming to see... me. They wanted to recruit, or kidnap, or just _see_ the archer in the woods. I couldn't do my job anymore.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:44:08.259000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225388819578930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"So I left. Surya hated to see me go, but she already got a lot of trouble for keeping me around; she thought a lot of Material Plane stuff I showed her was cool.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:47:21.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226200157356034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"So she gave me enough for this ticket. Told me to go far, and do what I did there for the world.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:49:13.401000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226668677628014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"...I still don't really know what that meant.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:49:21.459000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226702475591780","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"And that's... it?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:50:22.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226959888416850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
